===Etymology===
From {{compound|bread|winner|lang=en}}, where to {{m|en|win}} = to {{m|en|earn}}. Compare {{etyl|fy|-}} {{m|fy|breawinning||livelihood|lit=bread-winning}}, Dutch {{m|nl|broodwinning||livelihood}}.

